    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that there's no real end in sight. even when he finally passes, what's left for me? everything i used to be is just gone. i'm just a shadow of a person now, just waiting for the clock to run out. it doesn't even feel like living anymore, it just feels like being stuck in a loop of grief and exhaustion.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
