      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so heavy. sometimes i look at him and i dont even feel sad, i just feel this intense need for everything to just be quiet. for the stillness to finally happen. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i could just skip the next few years of this... if i could just find some actual peace.",
